{"id":"a769d89316a99993","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-finite-order-system.md","title":"Numeral Initial-Segment and Comparison Properties","display":"df-finite-order-system — Numeral Initial-Segment and Comparison Properties","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-finite-order-system","aliases":["92-df-finite-order-system"],"display":"df-finite-order-system — Numeral Initial-Segment and Comparison Properties","source":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）","source_status":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-finite-order-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-finite-order-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-order-system — Numeral Initial-Segment and Comparison Properties"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 68–71（PDF 85–88）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容与本地呈现已分开"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6ed78135d2cc20c6\" href=\"?note=6ed78135d2cc20c6\" title=\"92-df-bounded-quantifier\">92-df-bounded-quantifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> 为数码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 为本地加法关系缩写。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G\\)</span> 为下文定义的系统性质；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span> 使用经典等式演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}order\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall x\\bigl(x\\leq\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}x=\\bar j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall x(x\\leq\\bar n\\lor\\bar n\\leq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bar n\\leq\\bar n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}order\\text{-}system}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinOrder}_G(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall x\\bigl(x\\leq\\bar n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigvee_{j=0}^{n}x=\\bar j\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal S\\vdash\\forall x(x\\leq\\bar n\\lor\\bar n\\leq x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathcal S\\vdash\\bar n\\leq\\bar n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Ω₄（有限初始段）与 Ω₅（和固定数码可比较）在本地没有原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 的语法上的显式契约。把同一数码代入第二式得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\\leq\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\leq\\bar n\\)</span>，所以最后一项是冗余的，列出便于逐步证明。</p>\n<p>任意数码界下，已知每个有限实例可证时，可用初始段式与等式代入推出该界下全称句可证。它不同于从全部标准实例提升无界全称句的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 68–69；第 VI 章 pp. 78–80（PDF 85–86、95–97）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本地性质对应原书 Ω₄/Ω₅ 的逻辑用途；原书真实公理集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ee662ea7161b3d7\" href=\"?note=8ee662ea7161b3d7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems\">92-df-smullyan-weak-systems</a>。R₀ 只有 Ω₄，不满足这里列出的全部比较契约；其 Σ₀ 完备性仍由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" href=\"?note=cf0f2611d5bc4db4\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness\">92-thm-smullyan-weak-sigma0-completeness</a> 单独证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-bounded-quantifier","status":"resolved","id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-bounded-quantifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-weak-systems","status":"resolved","id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":